# Machine-local files and credentials
.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.mobileprovision
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/key.properties

# Reproducible build output and installed dependencies
**/build/
**/.codex-build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.gradle/
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
/outputs/

# Original device/host diagnostics and test helper binaries remain local.
# Keep JSON regression fixtures and official rule evidence in version control.
/docs/mobile/evidence/**/*.txt
/docs/mobile/evidence/**/*.png
/docs/mobile/evidence/**/*.jpg
/docs/mobile/evidence/**/*.mp4
/docs/mobile/evidence/**/*.apk
/docs/repository/local/

# Override a machine-global ignore so iOS dependencies stay reproducible.
!/flutter_app/ios/Podfile.lock
